1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:38,260
=Episode 20=

4
00:01:39,740 --> 00:01:40,540
I want more!

5
00:01:41,050 --> 00:01:42,540
Just one more.

6
00:01:42,690 --> 00:01:44,260
- Is there more?
- Is there more?

7
00:01:44,740 --> 00:01:45,490
I want that one!

8
00:01:46,130 --> 00:01:46,690
I didn't realize

9
00:01:47,490 --> 00:01:48,540
you liked children so much.

10
00:01:48,690 --> 00:01:49,980
This is delicious!

11
00:01:50,900 --> 00:01:51,430
No more.

12
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,230
Still hungry?

13
00:01:52,290 --> 00:01:53,020
Yes.

14
00:01:53,850 --> 00:01:54,620
I don't like children.

15
00:01:56,380 --> 00:01:56,820
Your Highness,

16
00:01:57,460 --> 00:01:58,380
but just now...

17
00:01:58,490 --> 00:01:58,980
Yan Shang!

18
00:01:59,210 --> 00:02:00,100
I don't like children!

19
00:02:00,460 --> 00:02:01,180
Do I make myself clear?

20
00:02:06,620 --> 00:02:07,020
I'm sorry.

21
00:02:08,130 --> 00:02:09,030
Here, have one.

22
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:10,030
Let me try!

23
00:02:10,260 --> 00:02:10,950
Let me try!

24
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:11,910
- Here.
- This one's mine!

25
00:02:12,060 --> 00:02:12,980
Try this one.

26
00:02:13,060 --> 00:02:13,610
I'm going back.

27
00:02:14,060 --> 00:02:15,130
Give me one.

28
00:02:15,780 --> 00:02:16,410
Look at this.

29
00:02:16,690 --> 00:02:17,500
I want more!

30
00:02:18,060 --> 00:02:19,500
I want another one.

31
00:02:19,690 --> 00:02:20,850
- Is there more?
- Is there more?

32
00:02:20,940 --> 00:02:21,730
Aren't you going back?

33
00:02:21,780 --> 00:02:22,500
I want this one.

34
00:02:22,690 --> 00:02:23,420
Don't grab it!

35
00:02:23,470 --> 00:02:25,840
- It's mine!
- I've only got one left!

36
00:02:26,340 --> 00:02:26,610
Right.

37
00:02:27,940 --> 00:02:29,220
Your Highness, go on without me.

38
00:02:29,850 --> 00:02:30,730
I still have things to do.

39
00:02:32,850 --> 00:02:33,380
Smells delicious!

40
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:34,690
Here, give me one.

41
00:02:36,380 --> 00:02:37,130
Smells delicious!

42
00:02:37,540 --> 00:02:38,290
Smells delicious!

43
00:02:53,410 --> 00:02:54,780
Of course he'd mind.

44
00:03:01,260 --> 00:03:02,940
Who wouldn't?

45
00:03:08,570 --> 00:03:09,570
Even I...

46
00:03:34,010 --> 00:03:34,410
Your Highness!

47
00:03:37,340 --> 00:03:38,100
(Princess Danyang's Residence)
Did you just get here?

48
00:03:38,570 --> 00:03:39,690
I thought you'd be home by now.

49
00:03:40,980 --> 00:03:41,450
What's wrong?

50
00:03:42,380 --> 00:03:43,130
Where have you been?

51
00:03:46,380 --> 00:03:47,100
They're all gone.

52
00:03:47,850 --> 00:03:48,890
You didn't save one for yourself.

53
00:03:49,410 --> 00:03:50,570
So I went to buy more.

54
00:03:51,130 --> 00:03:52,170
The shops were already closed.

55
00:03:52,660 --> 00:03:53,610
I knocked for ages.

56
00:03:59,010 --> 00:03:59,450
Aren't you cold?

57
00:04:00,060 --> 00:04:00,340
Come on.

58
00:04:01,060 --> 00:04:01,570
Get inside.

59
00:04:15,100 --> 00:04:15,890
Why are you so clumsy?

60
00:04:16,140 --> 00:04:17,250
Didn't you play with these as a child?

61
00:04:17,850 --> 00:04:18,340
No.

62
00:04:19,020 --> 00:04:19,670
When I was little,

63
00:04:19,720 --> 00:04:21,480
I spent every day
studying and doing farm work.

64
00:04:22,140 --> 00:04:22,580
Unlike you,

65
00:04:23,460 --> 00:04:24,170
always so mischievous.

66
00:04:24,170 --> 00:04:27,820
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

67
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:32,140
♪Be the sleeve we held♪

68
00:04:32,140 --> 00:04:32,490
Try it.

69
00:04:32,490 --> 00:04:35,720
♪Worn by dust and years♪

70
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:37,250
♪Let's conspire♪

71
00:04:37,250 --> 00:04:37,700
Is it good?

72
00:04:37,700 --> 00:04:41,980
♪To grow old together♪

73
00:04:42,810 --> 00:04:43,140
Wipe your mouth.

74
00:04:44,260 --> 00:04:49,200
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

75
00:04:49,250 --> 00:04:49,730
You have some too.

76
00:04:49,900 --> 00:04:55,930
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- Let grief drown in your eyes♪

77
00:04:57,630 --> 00:05:00,614
♪Soar with the wind,
burning bright as a song♪

78
00:05:00,615 --> 00:05:02,480
♪Plunge into hellfire as one♪

79
00:05:02,700 --> 00:05:05,850
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

80
00:05:06,580 --> 00:05:11,210
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

81
00:05:11,790 --> 00:05:15,890
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

82
00:05:16,580 --> 00:05:18,430
♪Not a single hour less♪

83
00:05:18,480 --> 00:05:25,480
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

84
00:05:26,140 --> 00:05:29,320
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

85
00:05:29,680 --> 00:05:33,000
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

86
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:34,460
♪If we can stay♪

87
00:05:34,460 --> 00:05:34,810
Your Highness.

88
00:05:36,580 --> 00:05:37,100
What's wrong?

89
00:05:37,810 --> 00:05:39,250
I loved reading as a child.

90
00:05:40,290 --> 00:05:40,700
And now,

91
00:05:41,460 --> 00:05:42,250
I still do.

92
00:05:43,220 --> 00:05:44,250
What you loved as a child,

93
00:05:45,050 --> 00:05:45,490
you can

94
00:05:46,410 --> 00:05:47,580
still love as an adult.

95
00:05:47,580 --> 00:05:50,460
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain♪

96
00:05:50,460 --> 00:05:51,220
That's different.

97
00:05:52,140 --> 00:05:53,050
These little things

98
00:05:53,610 --> 00:05:55,050
are meant to be gifts

99
00:05:55,290 --> 00:05:56,340
that bring you joy.

100
00:05:57,220 --> 00:05:58,290
If you have to buy for yourself

101
00:05:58,610 --> 00:05:59,490
everything you want,

102
00:06:00,220 --> 00:06:00,980
how sad is that?

103
00:06:01,490 --> 00:06:02,050
That won't happen to me.

104
00:06:07,490 --> 00:06:07,980
Then

105
00:06:08,700 --> 00:06:09,660
I'll buy them for you.

106
00:06:11,140 --> 00:06:12,900
Whether you're ten

107
00:06:13,460 --> 00:06:13,850
or

108
00:06:14,610 --> 00:06:15,610
twenty.

109
00:06:17,380 --> 00:06:22,320
♪Let me be the fireflies
dancing across your brow♪

110
00:06:25,610 --> 00:06:26,700
You spent next to nothing,

111
00:06:27,170 --> 00:06:28,100
and you're making me sad.

112
00:06:30,060 --> 00:06:33,466
♪Together we'll soar to the skies,
burning bright as a song♪

113
00:06:33,467 --> 00:06:35,170
♪Together we'll turn to ashes♪

114
00:06:35,220 --> 00:06:36,210
Your embroidered shoes are wet.

115
00:06:36,260 --> 00:06:38,240
♪Two shadows entwined,
a beautiful sight♪

116
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:38,660
Your Highness,

117
00:06:40,580 --> 00:06:41,370
let me take you back to your room.

118
00:06:41,370 --> 00:06:45,010
♪Be the vow I whisper again and again♪

119
00:06:45,010 --> 00:06:49,110
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

120
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,650
♪Not a single hour less♪

121
00:06:51,700 --> 00:06:58,700
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

122
00:06:59,360 --> 00:07:02,540
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

123
00:07:02,900 --> 00:07:06,220
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

124
00:07:06,390 --> 00:07:12,990
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world,
let's return to when we first met♪

125
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:16,000
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

126
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:18,030
♪- May time be free of pain;
- Lights fade, seasons turn♪

127
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:20,540
♪You're the only one I need♪

128
00:07:20,880 --> 00:07:27,870
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

129
00:07:28,020 --> 00:07:31,470
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

130
00:07:31,750 --> 00:07:34,490
♪My last untouched innocence♪

131
00:08:34,700 --> 00:08:35,420
May I?

132
00:08:36,820 --> 00:08:37,340
Your Highness.

133
00:08:38,850 --> 00:08:39,700
What did you call me?

134
00:08:48,220 --> 00:08:48,730
Wanyao.

135
00:09:22,940 --> 00:09:23,940
You're so clumsy.

136
00:09:24,300 --> 00:09:25,180
You can't do anything right.

137
00:09:25,370 --> 00:09:26,100
I have to teach you everything.

138
00:11:50,060 --> 00:11:50,490
Mr. Wang.

139
00:11:52,060 --> 00:11:52,340
Mr. Xu.

140
00:11:53,100 --> 00:11:54,220
What do you make

141
00:11:54,850 --> 00:11:55,770
of this passage?

142
00:11:58,490 --> 00:11:59,250
You mean

143
00:11:59,820 --> 00:12:00,250
this one?

144
00:12:05,340 --> 00:12:05,700
Mr. Xu,

145
00:12:07,010 --> 00:12:07,700
look at Mr. Yan.

146
00:12:08,650 --> 00:12:10,890
Early morning,
not seriously proofreading,

147
00:12:11,460 --> 00:12:12,490
his face is all flushed.

148
00:12:13,580 --> 00:12:14,220
What do you think

149
00:12:15,100 --> 00:12:16,300
he's thinking about?

150
00:12:16,700 --> 00:12:17,580
I suppose...

151
00:12:18,530 --> 00:12:19,910
Look at that glowing face,

152
00:12:19,960 --> 00:12:21,270
so full of youthful vigor.

153
00:12:23,460 --> 00:12:24,370
Without the Princess,

154
00:12:24,940 --> 00:12:25,820
could a nobody like him

155
00:12:26,650 --> 00:12:27,820
have come third?

156
00:12:29,460 --> 00:12:30,460
Everyone has their own fate.

157
00:13:14,220 --> 00:13:15,580
Congratulations, Mr. Liu.

158
00:13:17,700 --> 00:13:18,180
After you.

159
00:13:27,530 --> 00:13:28,180
Stop staring.

160
00:13:28,890 --> 00:13:30,460
You're not destined for promotion.

161
00:13:30,700 --> 00:13:31,180
Wenji.

162
00:13:40,730 --> 00:13:41,340
Rice cake!

163
00:13:42,180 --> 00:13:42,490
Try some.

164
00:13:49,060 --> 00:13:49,490
I never thought

165
00:13:49,820 --> 00:13:51,130
I'd get to eat rice cake in Sheng'an.

166
00:13:54,580 --> 00:13:56,100
You should make a wish with a rice cake,

167
00:13:56,610 --> 00:13:57,460
just like we used to.

168
00:13:59,890 --> 00:14:00,650
Just like we used to!

169
00:14:01,820 --> 00:14:02,130
I wish

170
00:14:02,700 --> 00:14:03,420
my parents good health

171
00:14:03,820 --> 00:14:04,490
and peace throughout the land.

172
00:14:04,770 --> 00:14:05,100
And...

173
00:14:07,700 --> 00:14:08,420
may you reach the highest rank!

174
00:14:13,130 --> 00:14:13,650
May you

175
00:14:14,420 --> 00:14:15,220
rise to the very top.

176
00:14:18,130 --> 00:14:19,460
Is it authentic rice cake?

177
00:14:19,820 --> 00:14:20,340
I haven't tried it yet.

178
00:14:21,530 --> 00:14:21,890
Try some for yourself.

179
00:14:33,770 --> 00:14:34,850
- Not quite authentic.
- Not quite authentic!

180
00:14:38,610 --> 00:14:39,530
I'll buy it from another shop next time.

181
00:14:51,100 --> 00:14:51,490
What's wrong?

182
00:15:06,650 --> 00:15:07,010
Yan Shang.

183
00:15:08,100 --> 00:15:10,130
I've been lucky to have you by my side

184
00:15:11,770 --> 00:15:12,650
after all I've been through.

185
00:15:17,700 --> 00:15:18,770
Back at the local school,

186
00:15:19,180 --> 00:15:20,220
how much did you help me?

187
00:15:20,940 --> 00:15:21,580
If I counted them all,

188
00:15:22,010 --> 00:15:22,890
I'd lose count.

189
00:15:25,130 --> 00:15:26,490
Just get to the point.

190
00:15:32,650 --> 00:15:32,940
Yan Shang.

191
00:15:34,250 --> 00:15:34,940
Actually...

192
00:15:37,220 --> 00:15:38,100
Yu Cheng'an talked to me.

193
00:15:54,180 --> 00:15:55,220
I nearly forgot all about you.

194
00:15:55,890 --> 00:15:57,340
You certainly know
how to keep your cool.

195
00:15:57,820 --> 00:15:58,980
Always so quiet.

196
00:16:00,460 --> 00:16:00,940
I...

197
00:16:02,300 --> 00:16:03,250
dared not disturb you.

198
00:16:06,060 --> 00:16:07,650
I heard you used to study.

199
00:16:08,180 --> 00:16:09,340
Why become a eunuch?

200
00:16:10,130 --> 00:16:10,420
In reply

201
00:16:11,010 --> 00:16:11,730
to Lord Yu,

202
00:16:12,340 --> 00:16:12,730
I...

203
00:16:13,250 --> 00:16:15,340
once hoped to become an official,

204
00:16:16,370 --> 00:16:17,340
but fate had other plans.

205
00:16:18,100 --> 00:16:19,370
I met with misfortune.

206
00:16:23,770 --> 00:16:27,100
Scholars have always
looked down on eunuchs.

207
00:16:27,530 --> 00:16:30,060
You must resent that.

208
00:16:33,820 --> 00:16:34,890
In reply to Lord Yu,

209
00:16:35,940 --> 00:16:36,530
I wouldn't dare.

210
00:16:40,300 --> 00:16:40,580
But...

211
00:16:42,610 --> 00:16:43,820
I do resent it.

212
00:16:49,610 --> 00:16:50,300
Tell me.

213
00:16:51,850 --> 00:16:52,770
Ten years of hard study,

214
00:16:54,580 --> 00:16:55,770
all to pass the exams

215
00:16:57,220 --> 00:16:58,530
and make a name for myself.

216
00:16:59,220 --> 00:16:59,650
But now,

217
00:17:01,530 --> 00:17:02,820
I failed.

218
00:17:08,700 --> 00:17:09,620
Then

219
00:17:10,900 --> 00:17:13,620
you should've stayed
in the Imperial Cuisine Service,

220
00:17:14,330 --> 00:17:15,460
enjoying free food.

221
00:17:16,010 --> 00:17:17,620
You'd have got by just fine.

222
00:17:18,250 --> 00:17:20,460
Why go to Hongwen Hall,

223
00:17:20,510 --> 00:17:22,720
a place with no perks?

224
00:17:28,180 --> 00:17:30,530
Seems your ambition to climb higher

225
00:17:34,420 --> 00:17:35,660
is still alive and well.

226
00:17:38,860 --> 00:17:40,010
I wouldn't dare deceive you, Lord Yu.

227
00:17:41,810 --> 00:17:43,050
What I mean is,

228
00:17:45,010 --> 00:17:45,900
as a eunuch,

229
00:17:46,900 --> 00:17:47,290
must I

230
00:17:48,050 --> 00:17:49,620
spend my life serving tea,

231
00:17:50,140 --> 00:17:51,180
forever at others' beck and call?

232
00:17:51,860 --> 00:17:53,050
I've read some books

233
00:17:53,900 --> 00:17:54,860
and know a fair bit,

234
00:17:55,810 --> 00:17:57,220
so why shouldn't I aim higher?

235
00:17:58,700 --> 00:17:59,420
And Hongwen Hall

236
00:18:00,620 --> 00:18:02,420
offers better prospects
than the Imperial Cuisine Service.

237
00:18:27,490 --> 00:18:27,980
Does he want

238
00:18:28,490 --> 00:18:29,010
to recruit you?

239
00:18:31,290 --> 00:18:31,570
No.

240
00:18:33,220 --> 00:18:33,730
Perhaps

241
00:18:35,140 --> 00:18:36,010
he just asked out of curiosity.

242
00:18:41,420 --> 00:18:41,700
Yan Shang,

243
00:18:43,810 --> 00:18:44,330
what do you think?

244
00:18:49,050 --> 00:18:49,660
Wenji,

245
00:18:51,050 --> 00:18:51,860
do you ever feel

246
00:18:52,660 --> 00:18:53,490
you could've done more?

247
00:19:01,220 --> 00:19:02,090
Princess Danyang

248
00:19:02,730 --> 00:19:03,770
helped me enter
the Imperial Cuisine Service.

249
00:19:04,770 --> 00:19:05,530
And with your help,

250
00:19:06,860 --> 00:19:07,980
I got a post at Hongwen Hall.

251
00:19:09,620 --> 00:19:10,490
That fulfilled

252
00:19:12,220 --> 00:19:13,180
my dream as a scholar.

253
00:19:16,330 --> 00:19:17,620
I couldn't ask for more.

254
00:19:18,810 --> 00:19:19,700
But now,

255
00:19:20,810 --> 00:19:22,140
I've been thrown into endless hell,

256
00:19:23,140 --> 00:19:24,250
left broken and ruined.

257
00:19:25,900 --> 00:19:26,660
Some things,

258
00:19:29,490 --> 00:19:30,900
I understand far better

259
00:19:31,660 --> 00:19:32,250
than I used to.

260
00:19:34,860 --> 00:19:36,530
So many people study for ten years,

261
00:19:37,570 --> 00:19:38,420
only to seek

262
00:19:38,980 --> 00:19:40,010
enough food and warmth.

263
00:19:41,700 --> 00:19:42,490
Those who become eunuchs

264
00:19:43,620 --> 00:19:45,220
seek nothing more than a steady income.

265
00:19:48,140 --> 00:19:49,730
Shouldn't we aim higher,

266
00:19:50,420 --> 00:19:52,220
all the way to the heart
of the Imperial Palace?

267
00:19:54,490 --> 00:19:55,220
Wenji,

268
00:19:55,980 --> 00:19:56,980
that's a dangerous path.

269
00:20:05,490 --> 00:20:06,090
Especially since

270
00:20:06,660 --> 00:20:08,220
Yu Cheng'an harmed Chunhua.

271
00:20:09,620 --> 00:20:10,380
Thanks for the warning.

272
00:20:12,770 --> 00:20:13,810
I haven't forgotten it.

273
00:20:16,730 --> 00:20:17,380
But Yan Shang,

274
00:20:18,460 --> 00:20:19,490
ever since you came to Sheng'an,

275
00:20:20,810 --> 00:20:21,810
entered the Princess's residence,

276
00:20:22,660 --> 00:20:23,660
and visited the Investigation Office,

277
00:20:24,730 --> 00:20:26,250
which path you've taken
hasn't been dangerous?

278
00:20:27,660 --> 00:20:29,330
I'm only looking for a way to rise.

279
00:20:30,220 --> 00:20:30,870
I'm not about

280
00:20:30,920 --> 00:20:32,310
to risk my life for Yu Cheng'an.

281
00:20:35,460 --> 00:20:36,290
But I'm worried about you.

282
00:20:45,660 --> 00:20:45,980
Thank you.

283
00:20:56,570 --> 00:20:57,140
Wenji.

284
00:20:59,010 --> 00:20:59,730
I should thank you

285
00:21:01,490 --> 00:21:02,860
for speaking so frankly with me.

286
00:21:10,010 --> 00:21:10,660
It's getting late.

287
00:21:12,090 --> 00:21:12,460
Yan Shang,

288
00:21:13,570 --> 00:21:14,380
let me see you out of the palace.

289
00:21:22,940 --> 00:21:24,330
Tell me what you really think.

290
00:21:25,090 --> 00:21:25,700
I wouldn't mind

291
00:21:26,420 --> 00:21:27,420
if you laughed at my sincere words.

292
00:21:30,010 --> 00:21:30,530
I think,

293
00:21:32,010 --> 00:21:33,010
in ancient times,

294
00:21:33,250 --> 00:21:35,090
there was the Grand Historian.

295
00:21:35,730 --> 00:21:36,290
And today,

296
00:21:37,980 --> 00:21:38,770
there's Lord Yu,

297
00:21:39,460 --> 00:21:40,530
head of the eunuchs

298
00:21:41,180 --> 00:21:43,620
and a pillar of the Huai Dynasty.

299
00:22:04,530 --> 00:22:05,250
With Lord Yu as my example,

300
00:22:05,810 --> 00:22:06,530
I believe

301
00:22:06,770 --> 00:22:07,900
whether eunuch or court official,

302
00:22:08,250 --> 00:22:09,860
what matters is
making a name in history.

303
00:22:10,620 --> 00:22:11,700
To rise through the ranks,

304
00:22:12,090 --> 00:22:13,420
the imperial exams aren't the only path.

305
00:22:14,180 --> 00:22:15,290
Can't a eunuch have

306
00:22:15,730 --> 00:22:16,620
a future of his own?

307
00:22:20,660 --> 00:22:21,290
Indeed.

308
00:22:22,220 --> 00:22:23,220
A fortune can't compare

309
00:22:23,860 --> 00:22:24,900
to the wisdom in books.

310
00:22:31,980 --> 00:22:34,660
If my foolish son could be like you,

311
00:22:35,770 --> 00:22:37,860
speaking such wisdom on the spot,

312
00:22:38,900 --> 00:22:40,090
I'd have nothing to worry about.

313
00:22:41,570 --> 00:22:42,220
You flatter me.

314
00:22:44,010 --> 00:22:44,730
Wenji.

315
00:22:46,940 --> 00:22:47,570
As for me,

316
00:22:48,490 --> 00:22:50,290
I've trained eunuchs before.

317
00:22:50,730 --> 00:22:52,290
They're loyal enough.

318
00:22:53,140 --> 00:22:53,900
However,

319
00:22:54,570 --> 00:22:56,900
they've read too little

320
00:22:57,980 --> 00:22:58,900
and lack the knowledge.

321
00:22:59,570 --> 00:23:00,420
They're not fit for great things.

322
00:23:02,660 --> 00:23:04,490
I'm willing to learn from you

323
00:23:05,420 --> 00:23:06,180
and I'll do my utmost

324
00:23:06,570 --> 00:23:07,620
to serve you faithfully!

325
00:23:13,730 --> 00:23:14,290
You may go.

326
00:23:20,900 --> 00:23:21,290
I will

327
00:23:23,380 --> 00:23:23,770
take my leave.

328
00:23:42,460 --> 00:23:43,530
(Since coming to Sheng'an,)

329
00:23:45,290 --> 00:23:46,290
(I've suffered
one setback after another,)

330
00:23:47,570 --> 00:23:49,050
(fallen into a bottomless abyss.)

331
00:23:51,420 --> 00:23:53,380
(At last, there's a glimmer of hope.)

332
00:23:56,050 --> 00:23:56,380
(Yan Shang,)

333
00:23:57,620 --> 00:23:59,220
(how could I let this chance slip away?)

334
00:24:01,220 --> 00:24:02,010
(You told me,)

335
00:24:03,220 --> 00:24:04,770
(even without hope,)

336
00:24:05,570 --> 00:24:07,330
(I must live for what I believe in.)

337
00:24:08,090 --> 00:24:09,900
(Taking down a petty man like Zhang Jun)

338
00:24:10,620 --> 00:24:13,350
(took the Princess
and the third-ranked scholar)

339
00:24:13,400 --> 00:24:14,350
(working so hard together.)

340
00:24:16,570 --> 00:24:17,530
(But my enemies)

341
00:24:19,050 --> 00:24:21,250
(are far more powerful than Zhang Jun.)

342
00:24:24,220 --> 00:24:25,010
(Power)

343
00:24:26,330 --> 00:24:28,380
(counts for nothing)

344
00:24:30,010 --> 00:24:31,330
(except)

345
00:24:32,700 --> 00:24:33,660
(before greater power.)

346
00:24:38,980 --> 00:24:39,900
(Within these palace walls,)

347
00:24:41,570 --> 00:24:43,770
(who knows if there's no path for me)

348
00:24:45,730 --> 00:24:47,140
(to reach the very top?)

349
00:24:58,860 --> 00:24:59,290
Your Highness,

350
00:24:59,700 --> 00:25:01,420
will you wear this pearl hairpin
again today?

351
00:25:02,220 --> 00:25:03,250
I'll do your hair now.

352
00:25:08,290 --> 00:25:08,700
Cailian.

353
00:25:09,570 --> 00:25:10,420
Pick any outfit of mine.

354
00:25:10,860 --> 00:25:12,220
I'm giving it to you.

355
00:25:13,290 --> 00:25:14,460
Lend me

356
00:25:14,770 --> 00:25:15,290
what you're wearing.

357
00:25:15,740 --> 00:25:16,980
(Cailian, Princess Danyang's Maid)

358
00:25:23,220 --> 00:25:24,420
(Hongwen Hall; Pursuit of Wisdom)
See you tomorrow, Mr. Wang.

359
00:25:24,660 --> 00:25:25,500
All right. See you tomorrow.

360
00:25:25,550 --> 00:25:26,030
Take care.

361
00:25:26,080 --> 00:25:26,450
I'm off.

362
00:25:27,810 --> 00:25:28,860
(Quiet Contemplation)
Remember to proofread this.

363
00:25:33,220 --> 00:25:33,730
Yan Shang,

364
00:25:34,220 --> 00:25:35,220
why aren't you heading home?

365
00:25:35,330 --> 00:25:36,620
Your maid is waiting outside.

366
00:25:37,570 --> 00:25:38,290
A maid?

367
00:25:38,770 --> 00:25:39,330
Mine?

368
00:25:39,570 --> 00:25:40,940
Yes, that's what she said.

369
00:25:41,050 --> 00:25:41,730
She's here to pick you up.

370
00:25:50,460 --> 00:25:50,940
Yan Shang,

371
00:25:51,730 --> 00:25:53,330
your maid is absolutely stunning.

372
00:26:01,010 --> 00:26:01,620
She certainly is.

373
00:26:02,180 --> 00:26:03,390
I couldn't find a woman like her

374
00:26:03,440 --> 00:26:04,550
in my household.

375
00:26:05,620 --> 00:26:06,090
Yan Shang,

376
00:26:06,620 --> 00:26:07,980
would you be willing

377
00:26:08,420 --> 00:26:08,860
to part with her?

378
00:26:11,140 --> 00:26:12,620
Yan Shang, you should let her go.

379
00:26:13,010 --> 00:26:15,530
If you're willing to give her to me,

380
00:26:16,050 --> 00:26:16,730
you can name

381
00:26:17,140 --> 00:26:18,090
your price.

382
00:26:19,620 --> 00:26:20,730
This is no joking matter.

383
00:26:26,180 --> 00:26:27,700
Your Highness, what brings you here?

384
00:26:36,940 --> 00:26:38,090
Is a maid just an object

385
00:26:38,810 --> 00:26:39,620
for you to take?

386
00:26:40,660 --> 00:26:42,140
You petty officials

387
00:26:42,490 --> 00:26:43,380
dare to ask for me?

388
00:26:44,530 --> 00:26:44,940
What,

389
00:26:45,940 --> 00:26:47,090
have you grown tired of your wives?

390
00:26:48,290 --> 00:26:49,420
Now you want to marry a princess?

391
00:26:50,380 --> 00:26:51,090
I failed to welcome you

392
00:26:51,460 --> 00:26:52,290
and kept you waiting, Your Highness.

393
00:26:53,140 --> 00:26:53,860
I deserve death.

394
00:26:55,220 --> 00:26:55,890
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

395
00:26:55,940 --> 00:26:56,730
Your Highness, please forgive me.

396
00:27:06,380 --> 00:27:07,140
Calm down.

397
00:27:07,290 --> 00:27:08,010
Dear Yan Shang,

398
00:27:08,530 --> 00:27:09,900
aren't you happy to see me here?

399
00:27:10,530 --> 00:27:11,860
Wanyao, stop fooling around.

400
00:27:16,090 --> 00:27:16,460
Your Highness,

401
00:27:17,090 --> 00:27:18,620
it's dangerous to travel incognito.

402
00:27:19,530 --> 00:27:20,420
Let's go back.

403
00:27:20,860 --> 00:27:21,700
Free time's rare.

404
00:27:21,810 --> 00:27:22,900
That's why I dressed this way.

405
00:27:24,980 --> 00:27:25,940
I'm so glad

406
00:27:26,290 --> 00:27:27,010
you came to get me.

407
00:27:28,660 --> 00:27:29,290
So where shall we go?

408
00:27:30,010 --> 00:27:30,940
During the Double Festival,

409
00:27:31,250 --> 00:27:32,620
the Emperor lifts the curfew.

410
00:27:33,290 --> 00:27:34,050
I want to see the night market.

411
00:27:35,420 --> 00:27:36,490
Your Highness, but...

412
00:27:37,730 --> 00:27:39,330
The Princess has an order.
Yan Shang, you must obey.

413
00:27:41,900 --> 00:27:42,220
All right.

414
00:27:43,330 --> 00:27:44,420
The Princess wishes
to visit the night market.

415
00:27:44,860 --> 00:27:46,050
Yan Shang of Hongwen Hall
will escort her.

416
00:27:46,420 --> 00:27:47,010
No disobedience.

417
00:27:48,140 --> 00:27:48,730
I obey.

418
00:27:49,490 --> 00:27:49,940
And one more thing,

419
00:27:50,570 --> 00:27:51,010
tonight,

420
00:27:51,330 --> 00:27:52,250
don't call me "Your Highness".

421
00:27:53,570 --> 00:27:54,490
I obey.

422
00:27:55,570 --> 00:27:55,860
Let's go.

423
00:27:59,940 --> 00:28:01,660
Look! The fire-breather is amazing!

424
00:28:01,730 --> 00:28:02,220
Look!

425
00:28:08,480 --> 00:28:10,200
(Leming Tavern)

426
00:28:13,220 --> 00:28:13,660
(Jinxiu Silk House)

427
00:28:19,250 --> 00:28:19,570
How is it?

428
00:28:21,380 --> 00:28:22,050
Too big.

429
00:28:24,420 --> 00:28:24,770
This one!

430
00:28:32,810 --> 00:28:33,570
You look better without it.

431
00:28:34,570 --> 00:28:35,180
Let's check the others.

432
00:28:41,050 --> 00:28:41,860
So pretty!

433
00:28:45,380 --> 00:28:46,050
No, thanks.

434
00:29:00,010 --> 00:29:00,660
Let's look over there.

435
00:29:15,810 --> 00:29:16,420
What's this?

436
00:29:18,620 --> 00:29:19,220
No idea.

437
00:29:19,900 --> 00:29:20,380
No idea?

438
00:29:21,420 --> 00:29:23,330
I'm from Lingnan.
Of course I don't know.

439
00:29:23,660 --> 00:29:25,220
Then how come you, a local, don't know?

440
00:29:26,460 --> 00:29:28,530
I seldom hang out. How would I know?

441
00:29:29,140 --> 00:29:30,010
You country bumpkin!

442
00:29:30,980 --> 00:29:31,620
You don't even know this?

443
00:29:32,290 --> 00:29:33,330
Seldom hang out, huh?

444
00:29:36,540 --> 00:29:37,340
(Rose Pastry)

445
00:29:40,570 --> 00:29:40,940
Wanyao!

446
00:29:41,530 --> 00:29:42,900
I checked it. It's called rose pastry.

447
00:29:46,860 --> 00:29:47,330
Pretty?

448
00:29:50,330 --> 00:29:51,810
My colleagues didn't flatter you.

449
00:29:52,460 --> 00:29:53,050
My lady

450
00:29:53,730 --> 00:29:54,620
really is breathtaking.

451
00:29:58,180 --> 00:29:58,900
(Pretty!)

452
00:30:00,010 --> 00:30:01,180
What a flatterer,

453
00:30:02,700 --> 00:30:03,530
dear Yan Shang.

454
00:30:05,770 --> 00:30:06,290
Bravo!

455
00:30:06,660 --> 00:30:07,090
Bravo!

456
00:30:07,460 --> 00:30:08,290
So pretty!

457
00:30:09,090 --> 00:30:09,660
Yeah.

458
00:30:26,980 --> 00:30:27,530
Missed.

459
00:30:28,180 --> 00:30:28,660
Excuse me.

460
00:30:29,620 --> 00:30:30,010
Excuse me.

461
00:30:31,490 --> 00:30:31,740
Thanks.

462
00:30:31,790 --> 00:30:32,160
What good luck!

463
00:30:32,210 --> 00:30:32,690
Excuse me.

464
00:30:34,660 --> 00:30:34,950
Sir...

465
00:30:35,000 --> 00:30:35,640
Let's have a go too.

466
00:30:36,180 --> 00:30:36,460
All right.

467
00:30:37,770 --> 00:30:38,220
Sir,

468
00:30:38,530 --> 00:30:39,700
what's the first prize?

469
00:30:40,380 --> 00:30:40,860
That one.

470
00:30:44,770 --> 00:30:45,660
That's beautiful.

471
00:30:46,180 --> 00:30:46,570
I want it.

472
00:30:47,250 --> 00:30:48,090
Win one for me.

473
00:30:48,250 --> 00:30:48,570
Me?

474
00:30:49,570 --> 00:30:49,900
I...

475
00:30:50,860 --> 00:30:52,140
I can't.

476
00:30:54,220 --> 00:30:54,620
All right.

477
00:30:57,700 --> 00:30:58,290
Here, sir.

478
00:30:59,810 --> 00:31:00,660
Sir, the arrows are over there.

479
00:31:03,530 --> 00:31:03,900
Try that one.

480
00:31:12,940 --> 00:31:13,770
So close!

481
00:31:14,050 --> 00:31:14,570
Try again.

482
00:31:20,490 --> 00:31:21,530
Almost!

483
00:31:21,900 --> 00:31:23,740
See? One more won't help.

484
00:31:23,790 --> 00:31:24,380
One more!

485
00:31:24,430 --> 00:31:24,950
Let me try again.

486
00:31:25,620 --> 00:31:26,140
He'll make it this time.

487
00:31:26,220 --> 00:31:26,980
No chance.

488
00:31:29,220 --> 00:31:29,770
Let me show you.

489
00:31:47,530 --> 00:31:47,860
Again.

490
00:32:12,090 --> 00:32:13,090
My lady is amazing!

491
00:32:13,380 --> 00:32:13,770
One more time.

492
00:32:33,180 --> 00:32:34,090
Just one left.

493
00:32:34,490 --> 00:32:35,010
Try it yourself.

494
00:32:35,980 --> 00:32:37,460
Win or lose,

495
00:32:38,180 --> 00:32:39,140
the prize is ours.

496
00:32:41,140 --> 00:32:41,460
All right.

497
00:33:03,330 --> 00:33:04,250
How did it fall?

498
00:33:05,940 --> 00:33:07,020
It was fine a moment ago.

499
00:33:07,070 --> 00:33:07,790
The flower fell off.

500
00:33:13,180 --> 00:33:13,490
Sir?

501
00:33:14,140 --> 00:33:15,700
Why get rough, sir?

502
00:33:21,540 --> 00:33:23,580
(Meng Zaishi, Military Governor
of the Central Circuit, North Jing)

503
00:33:39,460 --> 00:33:40,250
I don't want the prize.

504
00:33:41,250 --> 00:33:42,530
Give it to that lady.

505
00:33:43,810 --> 00:33:44,460
Yes, sir.

506
00:33:47,050 --> 00:33:47,420
No need.

507
00:33:48,770 --> 00:33:49,090
My lady,

508
00:33:49,530 --> 00:33:50,050
let's go home.

509
00:33:53,010 --> 00:33:53,730
Ladies and gentlemen...

510
00:33:54,090 --> 00:33:55,090
Your Highness, it's been a while.

511
00:34:01,140 --> 00:34:02,530
What do you want?

512
00:34:06,220 --> 00:34:08,130
So, you found yourself a new lover?

513
00:34:09,490 --> 00:34:09,940
Let's go.

514
00:34:10,340 --> 00:34:10,820
What's the hurry?

515
00:34:12,940 --> 00:34:14,260
Don't you want your things back?

516
00:34:28,690 --> 00:34:29,820
You've got the wrong person.

517
00:34:30,610 --> 00:34:31,460
This is my wife,

518
00:34:31,940 --> 00:34:32,820
not some princess.

519
00:34:33,420 --> 00:34:34,210
There's no curfew tonight.

520
00:34:34,860 --> 00:34:36,610
The Imperial Guards are everywhere.

521
00:34:37,010 --> 00:34:37,980
Please, show some restraint.

522
00:34:38,340 --> 00:34:39,380
Don't cause a scene with the officials

523
00:34:40,010 --> 00:34:40,980
and spoil the festivities.

524
00:34:46,130 --> 00:34:46,460
Dear,

525
00:34:47,260 --> 00:34:47,820
let's go home.

526
00:34:51,420 --> 00:34:51,820
Don't look back.

527
00:35:15,300 --> 00:35:15,690
Your Highness,

528
00:35:16,650 --> 00:35:17,050
are you all right?

529
00:35:18,610 --> 00:35:19,170
That man...

530
00:35:20,690 --> 00:35:21,340
He didn't follow us.

531
00:35:23,210 --> 00:35:24,130
Who was he?

532
00:35:24,980 --> 00:35:26,740
He didn't seem to be a local.

533
00:35:28,170 --> 00:35:29,090
As you said,

534
00:35:30,570 --> 00:35:31,490
he mistook me for someone else.

535
00:35:34,980 --> 00:35:35,380
Yan Shang,

536
00:35:36,300 --> 00:35:37,050
I'm a little tired.

537
00:35:38,130 --> 00:35:39,210
Take me back to the residence.

538
00:35:59,460 --> 00:36:00,490
You can go rest now.

539
00:36:00,860 --> 00:36:01,570
Everything's fine here.

540
00:36:03,010 --> 00:36:03,420
Got it.

541
00:36:28,610 --> 00:36:30,130
Mother, I hit it!

542
00:36:31,490 --> 00:36:31,980
Mother,

543
00:36:32,300 --> 00:36:34,050
(Young Mu Wanyao)
let's see who can shoot more accurately.

544
00:36:35,130 --> 00:36:37,860
The other day,
Yang Si challenged you to archery.

545
00:36:38,570 --> 00:36:39,820
Why didn't you accept?

546
00:36:41,170 --> 00:36:42,980
Mother, I don't want
to compete with him.

547
00:36:43,490 --> 00:36:44,380
He cheats all the time.

548
00:36:44,900 --> 00:36:45,420
Mother,

549
00:36:45,860 --> 00:36:48,210
everyone gets a prize for competing.

550
00:36:48,780 --> 00:36:49,530
If I win,

551
00:36:49,780 --> 00:36:51,420
you should give me one too.

552
00:36:52,300 --> 00:36:54,340
So, what do you want?

553
00:36:56,530 --> 00:36:57,490
If I win,

554
00:36:57,980 --> 00:36:59,340
I want a hairpin.

555
00:36:59,940 --> 00:37:00,780
All right.

556
00:37:15,760 --> 00:37:18,650
(Rebellion
of the Seven Military Governors)

557
00:37:18,650 --> 00:37:19,130
Mother,

558
00:37:19,650 --> 00:37:20,740
where are we going?

559
00:37:21,170 --> 00:37:22,210
I don't know either.

560
00:37:23,820 --> 00:37:26,090
Mother, can we still go home?

561
00:37:26,490 --> 00:37:27,650
I don't want to leave Sheng'an.

562
00:37:28,780 --> 00:37:29,690
Of course we can.

563
00:37:30,460 --> 00:37:31,420
Once the rebels are defeated,

564
00:37:31,740 --> 00:37:32,690
we can go home.

565
00:37:46,740 --> 00:37:47,170
Your Majesty!

566
00:37:47,490 --> 00:37:49,170
Your Majesty, urgent news!

567
00:37:49,820 --> 00:37:51,570
Your Majesty, good news!

568
00:37:51,980 --> 00:37:52,460
Your Majesty!

569
00:37:52,980 --> 00:37:54,570
The rebels in Jiannan Circuit
have been defeated.

570
00:37:54,940 --> 00:37:57,570
Our forces captured
rebel leader Jia Xingzhang

571
00:37:58,050 --> 00:37:59,230
and executed him on the spot!

572
00:37:59,280 --> 00:38:00,000
Who led the troops?

573
00:38:00,490 --> 00:38:02,420
It was Yu Cheng'an!

574
00:38:02,490 --> 00:38:03,050
Good!

575
00:38:12,820 --> 00:38:14,570
Yu Cheng'an, senior palace attendant,

576
00:38:15,050 --> 00:38:16,490
rose to the occasion in a crisis...

577
00:38:18,080 --> 00:38:19,600
(Sheng'an)

578
00:38:31,740 --> 00:38:32,210
Mother.

579
00:38:33,490 --> 00:38:34,340
Apart from North Jing,

580
00:38:34,530 --> 00:38:36,130
are all the rebellions put down?

581
00:38:36,780 --> 00:38:37,260
Almost.

582
00:38:38,210 --> 00:38:39,610
We'll be back in Sheng'an soon.

583
00:38:41,580 --> 00:38:44,020
(Sheng'an)

584
00:38:56,610 --> 00:38:59,540
Meng Baiyu, Military Commander
of North Jing's Central Circuit,

585
00:38:59,590 --> 00:39:01,030
has shown great virtue and loyalty.

586
00:39:01,340 --> 00:39:02,650
We greatly commend him.

587
00:39:03,210 --> 00:39:05,260
Our eldest daughter, Princess Danyang,

588
00:39:05,610 --> 00:39:07,010
is gentle and virtuous,

589
00:39:07,490 --> 00:39:08,940
well-versed in propriety.

590
00:39:09,490 --> 00:39:10,300
We hereby decree

591
00:39:10,490 --> 00:39:11,820
that she be wed to Meng.

592
00:39:12,260 --> 00:39:13,490
Proclaim this far and wide.

593
00:39:13,980 --> 00:39:15,860
See that it is carried out.

594
00:39:17,780 --> 00:39:18,740
I beg you, Lord Yu.

595
00:39:21,340 --> 00:39:21,860
Your Highness

596
00:39:22,420 --> 00:39:23,650
has the support of the whole realm.

597
00:39:24,820 --> 00:39:27,430
Now war ravages the land,

598
00:39:27,480 --> 00:39:28,590
and the people are suffering.

599
00:39:29,490 --> 00:39:31,860
And Your Highness wants to stand aside?

600
00:39:32,740 --> 00:39:33,340
In times like these,

601
00:39:33,780 --> 00:39:35,130
how could that be acceptable?

602
00:40:00,860 --> 00:40:02,940
♪A daughter ventures forth♪

603
00:40:03,550 --> 00:40:05,990
♪In the name her father gave♪

604
00:40:06,950 --> 00:40:12,820
♪Into savage lands,
to tame tigers and slay wolves♪

605
00:40:13,650 --> 00:40:14,210
What are you doing?

606
00:40:14,980 --> 00:40:20,380
♪The fate is sealed,
a destiny bestowed by Heaven♪

607
00:40:21,410 --> 00:40:27,740
♪When did you decide to defy it,
to change it?♪

608
00:40:29,140 --> 00:40:31,120
(Mingde Gate)

609
00:40:31,120 --> 00:40:36,010
♪Defy its might,
and the submission it demands♪

610
00:40:36,540 --> 00:40:42,180
♪Defy its scorn,
stain the sky with blood♪

611
00:40:44,600 --> 00:40:48,560
♪We weren't born for sacrifice.
Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

612
00:40:48,560 --> 00:40:51,000
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪
(Central Circuit; North Jing)

613
00:40:51,000 --> 00:40:52,940
♪Cold as a blade,
yet peerless as a bloom♪

614
00:40:52,940 --> 00:40:54,090
The soldiers are charging!

615
00:40:54,990 --> 00:40:58,060
♪Who dares make me bow
down in the dust?♪

616
00:42:08,490 --> 00:42:09,170
Let me go!

617
00:42:20,460 --> 00:42:21,340
Put me down!

618
00:42:22,090 --> 00:42:22,940
By Central Circuit custom,

619
00:42:23,420 --> 00:42:24,650
the bride is seized.

620
00:42:25,210 --> 00:42:26,170
Don't you know?

621
00:42:26,610 --> 00:42:27,490
I'm from Sheng'an!

622
00:42:29,260 --> 00:42:30,300
Not for much longer!

623
00:42:33,340 --> 00:42:33,940
Your Highness!

624
00:42:42,610 --> 00:42:43,340
My hairpin!

625
00:43:11,680 --> 00:43:15,920
(With Bold, Majestic Strides)

626
00:43:49,980 --> 00:43:51,940
(So this is my husband-to-be?)

627
00:43:58,200 --> 00:44:00,600
(Meng Baiyu, Military Governor
of the Central Circuit, North Jing)

628
00:44:13,090 --> 00:44:15,300
You're not too pampered
to come after all.

629
00:44:15,650 --> 00:44:16,650
You are right.

630
00:44:18,530 --> 00:44:20,090
But married or not,

631
00:44:21,170 --> 00:44:22,050
wherever I go,

632
00:44:23,690 --> 00:44:24,940
I'm still a princess of Huai.

633
00:44:25,820 --> 00:44:26,940
Then today,

634
00:44:27,980 --> 00:44:29,860
it's time for the Princess of Huai

635
00:44:31,340 --> 00:44:32,740
to serve me in the bridal chamber.

636
00:44:37,980 --> 00:44:38,860
I'm from the Central Plains.

637
00:44:39,610 --> 00:44:40,380
By our custom,

638
00:44:40,820 --> 00:44:41,570
we haven't shared the wedding feast,

639
00:44:42,090 --> 00:44:42,650
drunk the nuptial wine,

640
00:44:43,380 --> 00:44:44,300
bowed to each other,

641
00:44:44,570 --> 00:44:45,170
or greeted our guests.

642
00:44:46,300 --> 00:44:47,300
How can we retire to the bridal chamber?

643
00:45:22,100 --> 00:45:26,500
(Next Episode Preview)

644
00:45:27,010 --> 00:45:28,900
We have to make it out alive.

645
00:45:31,170 --> 00:45:32,460
So is your father!

646
00:45:32,510 --> 00:45:34,280
And Yu Cheng'an's the biggest liar
of all!

647
00:45:35,490 --> 00:45:38,170
I'd never have spared
your worthless life!

648
00:45:43,320 --> 00:45:46,613
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

649
00:45:49,298 --> 00:45:54,214
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

650
00:45:56,408 --> 00:46:02,253
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

651
00:46:02,753 --> 00:46:07,979
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

652
00:46:10,748 --> 00:46:15,539
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

653
00:46:16,375 --> 00:46:22,454
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

654
00:46:24,255 --> 00:46:27,405
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

655
00:46:27,405 --> 00:46:29,053
♪Burning bright as a song♪

656
00:46:29,105 --> 00:46:32,829
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

657
00:46:33,207 --> 00:46:37,873
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

658
00:46:38,492 --> 00:46:42,533
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

659
00:46:43,024 --> 00:46:45,139
♪Not a single hour less♪

660
00:46:45,179 --> 00:46:52,125
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

661
00:46:52,888 --> 00:46:56,341
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

662
00:46:56,521 --> 00:46:59,666
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

663
00:47:00,105 --> 00:47:06,742
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

664
00:47:07,139 --> 00:47:09,177
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

665
00:47:09,177 --> 00:47:11,653
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

666
00:47:11,691 --> 00:47:14,160
♪You're the only one I need♪

667
00:47:14,364 --> 00:47:21,251
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

668
00:47:21,563 --> 00:47:24,834
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

669
00:47:25,139 --> 00:47:28,312
♪My last untouched innocence♪

670
00:47:28,636 --> 00:47:32,062
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

671
00:47:32,295 --> 00:47:35,520
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

672
00:47:35,851 --> 00:47:42,647
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

673
00:47:43,016 --> 00:47:45,078
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

674
00:47:45,079 --> 00:47:47,582
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

675
00:47:47,629 --> 00:47:49,967
♪You're the only one I need♪

676
00:47:50,198 --> 00:47:57,033
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

677
00:47:57,382 --> 00:47:59,000
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

678
00:47:59,130 --> 00:48:00,926
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

679
00:48:01,283 --> 00:48:04,300
♪You're the only one I need♪

680
00:48:04,340 --> 00:48:05,667
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)

